# The dependency-audit security gate (#3843, third owner decision). A mitigation
# record is a few lines of JSON that turn the required `Dependency audit` check
# green as MITIGATED, so adding or re-sealing one, changing a patch, or changing
# the code that judges them needs the owner's Approve. `pnpm-workspace.yaml` is
# deliberately NOT owned, so ordinary dependency bumps are unaffected.
/dependency-mitigations.d/**                   @thatskiff33
/patches/**                                    @thatskiff33
/scripts/ci/dependency-mitigation.mjs          @thatskiff33
/scripts/ci/audit-dependencies.mjs             @thatskiff33

